 of shopping malls and commercial hubs. In recent times, Kandivali has proven to be the top choice of families across the city boundaries, owing to fast connectivity, as well as newer developments in and around.\n\n“**Dosti Oro 67**” is a Project developed by one of the well-known Developers  Dosti Realty. The Project is perfectly located in Kandivali West Mumbai. The various configurations in which the flat units are available on sale in this project are**2 BHK With 585, 608 Carpet, And a Residential Apartment With Amenities**.  **Dosti Oro 67** Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar is a RERA-registered project with registration number **P51800029143**. The Residents Can Enjoy Beautiful Views And Natural\n\nGetting Here\n\n## Location & Nearby Connectivity\n\nNearest Metro\n\n**Dhanukarwadi Metro Station**\n\nNearest Railway\n\n**Kandivali Railway Station**\n\n## Amenities & Features\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nClub House\n\nEntrance Lobby\n\nEV Charging Station\n\nGazebo Sitting\n\nGym\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\nJogging Tread\n\nKids Play Area\n\nKids' Play Area\n\nMeditation &Amp; Yoga Zone\n\nMeditation Deck\n\nMultipurpose Lawn\n\nRain Harvesting\n\nSky Lounge\n\nSky Sit-Out\n\nSolar Panel\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nYoga Pavilion\n\nNeighbourhood\n\n## About Kandivali West\n\nKandivali West is a well-connected western suburb location with residential options across ready, resale and new-launch properties. Buyers usually compare projects here by carpet area, possession stage, connectivity, amenities and budget.For current availability in this neighbourhood, speak with Divya Housing Agency and compare verified options before booking a visit.\n\n [View all properties in Kandivali West →](https://divyahousingagency.com/area/kandivali-west/)\n\n**Client**Testimonials\n\nVisible feedback shown for trust; no self-serving review schema is generated.\n\n★★★★★\n\nFound our 2 BHK in Malad West within our budget in just 3 site visits. The team knew exactly which pockets to show us.\n\n**Rahul Sharma** 2 BHK buyer Evershine Nagar\n\n★★★★★\n\nOne call to Divya Housing and we had 4 genuine options the same week. No time wasting, no fake listings. Closed in 3 weeks.\n\n**Priya Mehta** 3 BHK buyer Goregaon West\n\n★★★★★\n\nTransparent brokerage no surprises at the end. Handled all paperwork and legal verification.\n\n**Anil Kulkarni** Resale flat Kandivali East\n\n[View Reviews on Google](https://share.google/yPM17jNN7ai2YgQ0t)\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions — Dosti Oro 67\n\n  What is the current price of Dosti Oro 67? + \n\nThe listed price is ₹1.46 Cr++. Prices are indicative and exclude stamp duty, registration and other applicable charges.\n\n   Which configuration is this listing in Dosti Oro 67? + \n\nThis listing is shown as a 2 BHK with carpet area of 585 SqFt. Current unit availability should be confirmed before scheduling a visit.\n\n   Where is Dosti Oro 67 located? + \n\nDosti Oro 67 is located in Kandivali West, Mumbai. Please confirm the exact visit location and current availability before planning a visit.\n\n   Is Dosti Oro 67 RERA registered? + \n\nYes, the MahaRERA number shown for this listing is P51800029143. Buyers should verify the registration on the official MahaRERA website before making a decision.\n\n   How can I schedule a site visit for Dosti Oro 67? + \n\nYou can call or WhatsApp to confirm availability, latest pricing and a suitable site visit time.\n\n## Other Available Homes in Dosti Oro 67\n\n[View Project →](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/dosti-oro-67-kandivali-west/)\n\n[![Dosti Oro 67](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Dosti-Ora--300x142.jpe) For Sale\n\n1 BHK 417 SqFt Kandivali West\n\n### Dosti Oro 67\n\n₹96 L++](https://divyahousingagency.com/property/dosti-oro-67/)\n\n[View All Options in This Project →](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/dosti-oro-67-kandivali-west/)\n\n## Similar Properties You May Like\n\n[![Shreeji Skyrise — 3 BHK in Kandivali West](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-conten