 417 Sq.ft To 652 Sq.ft Carpet Area with all necessities.  \n   \n**Location:-**  \nKandivali West has founded itself as the most so\n\nught-after location of tomorrow. Located on Mumbai’s Western line between Borivali and Malad, Kandivali West is basically a housing suburban area. With its vicinity to the Western Express Highway and an increased structure, the location is luring home buyers and retail players with a number of projects.  \n  \n**Developer:-**  \nDosti group established in 1980 in mumbai. Encompassing a portfolio of 8 mn. sq. ft. across Mumbai, the company has experience in various development types be it Residential, Retail, IT Parks etc. Over the years, it has been known for Aesthetics, Innovation, Quality, Timely Delivery, Trust and Transparency, Values that have built lasting relationships.  \n  \n**For more information about floor plans, brochures, payment plans, resale options, and apartments for investors, please contact us.**\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 417 Sq.ft Area | 90.00 Lacs |\n| 1 BHK | 447 Sq.ft Area | 96.47 Lacs |\n| 1 BHK | 456 Sq.ft Area | 98.41 Lacs |\n| 1.5 BHK | 526 Sq.ft Area | 1.18 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 585 Sq.ft Area | 1.30 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 608 Sq.ft Area | 1.35 CR |\n| 2.5 BHK | 652 Sq.ft Area | 1.52 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* 24 Hrs Backup Electricity   \n\\* Water Purifer   \n\\* Amphitheater   \n\\* CCTV Cameras   \n\\* Kids Pool   \n\\* Landscaped Garden   \n\\* Library   \n\\* Swimming Pool\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Overhead Water Tank/s  \n\\* Lift Machine Room  \n\\* Meter Room  \n\\* Fire Control Room\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n#