naws.com/website-prod-public/files/2256/original/fp.jpg?1623930451)\n\n[![Dosti Oro 67 Apartment 1 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/12605/original/1bhk.PNG?1623413079)[![Dosti Oro 67 Apartment 1 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/three_d_plans/12605/original/1bhk_3d.PNG?1623413079)[![Dosti Oro 67 Apartment 1 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/12604/original/1bhk.PNG?1623413078)[![Dosti Oro 67 Apartment 1 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/three_d_plans/12604/original/1bhk_3d.PNG?1623413079)[![Dosti Oro 67 Apartment 2 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/12607/original/2bhk.PNG?1623413079)[![Dosti Oro 67 Apartment 2 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/three_d_plans/12607/original/2bhk_3d.PNG?1623413079)\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800029143\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dosti-oro-67/105339/project","title":"Dosti Oro 67, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.25 Cr Onwards | 1, 2 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Dosti Group developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/dosti-group-572.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Dosti Oro 67 Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Dosti Oro 67 Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dosti-oro-67-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Dosti Oro 67 Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dosti-oro-67-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Dosti Oro 67 Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/dosti-oro-67-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Dosti Oro 67 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dosti-oro-67-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.25 Cr - 1.95 Cr**\n\n₹22,374 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Dosti Oro 67?\n\n## About Dosti Oro 67, Kandivali West by Dosti Group\n\n## Dosti Oro 67 Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Dosti Oro 67.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  417 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.25 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  457 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.37 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  526 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.58 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  587 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.76 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  652 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.95 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nDosti Oro 67's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Dosti Oro 67 | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 31100 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 27100 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 26600 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 27550 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nDosti Oro 67 avg. price is ₹ 31.1 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kolte Patil Evara](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-evara/113717/project \"Kolte Patil Evara\") | ₹ 36,800 |\n| [Paradigm Ananda Park](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-park/157970/project \"Paradigm Ananda Park\") | ₹ 31,600 |\n| Current Project **Dosti Oro 67** | ₹ 31,100 |\n| [Paradigm Revive](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-revive/107077/project \"Paradigm Revive\") | ₹ 28,050 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Dosti Oro 67 ranges from ₹ 35.2 K to ₹ 55 K with options available for 1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Dosti Oro 67 | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | ₹ 35.2 K | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 48 K | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 55 K | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Dosti Oro 67.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 8 residential transactions has been registered so far for Dosti Oro 67, amounting to ₹ 10 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Dosti Oro 67 ranges from ₹ 39 K to ₹ 55 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Dosti Oro 67 moved from ₹ 27,100/sqft to ₹ 31,100/sqft, reflecting a 14.76% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Dosti Oro 67 moved from ₹ 26,600/sqft to ₹ 27,100/sqft, reflecting a 1.88% rise.\n\nA total of 284 out of 287 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 99% of 2 BHK(78 out of 79 units), 97% of 2.5 BHK(64 out of 66 units), 100% of 1 BHK(123 units), 1.5 BHK(19 units).\n\nA total of 284 out of 287 launched units have been booked as of May 2024, including 99% of 2 BHK(78 out of 79 units), 97% of 2.5 BHK(64 out of 66 units), 100% of 1 BHK(123 units), 1.5 BHK(19 units).\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n8 Sales Transactions Registered in Dosti Oro 67 From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 21.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 8 | ₹ 10 Cr | ₹ 21,850 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Dosti Oro 67 Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 417 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dosti Oro 67, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dosti-oro-67-apartment-1-bhk-417sqft-20210307160314.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.25 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 457 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dosti Oro 67, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dosti-oro-67-apartment-1-bhk-457sqft-20215319105306.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.37 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 526 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dosti Oro 67, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dosti-oro-67-apartment-2-bhk-526sqft-20215419105448.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.58 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 587 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Dosti Oro 67, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/dosti-oro-67-apartme