sq. ft. of work across their various projects. \nThe company has delivered over 127 properties, all of which are a result of its team of employees who have contributed to every aspect of the business. The company's portfolio at present comprises a total of 6000 homes, 95 complexes, and more across Mumbai, Thane, Pune, and Ahmedabad. \nThe company's focus has been on delivering affordable luxury to all its customers, and this is across its residential and commercial offerings. They've also prioritised ensuring that their projects are environmentally sustainable and incorporate vast green spaces to provide a sense of being at one with nature.\n\n![Dosti Eastern Bay residential project in Wadala](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dosti-eastern-bay-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWadala, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.92 Cr to 7.29 Cr\n\n![Dosti Mezzo 22 residential project in Sion East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dosti-mezzo-22-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSion East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.90 Cr to 6.44 Cr\n\n![Dosti Eastern Bay Phase 3 residential project in Wadala](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dosti-eastern-bay-phase-3-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWadala, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.95 Cr to 4.80 Cr\n\n![Dosti Eastern Bay Phase 2 residential project in Wadala](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dosti-eastern-bay-phase-2-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWadala, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.92 Cr to 3.41 Cr\n\n![Dosti Residency residential project in Vasai West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dosti-residency-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVasai West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 24.83 Lac to 65.04 Lac\n\n![Dosti Flamingo